<title>GREECE: GREEK INSTITUTIONALS ORGANISED SEMINAR ON EQUITY DERIVATIVES.</title>
<headline>GREEK INSTITUTIONALS ORGANISED SEMINAR ON EQUITY DERIVATIVES.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The president of the U.S. consultants CBM Group, Andre Cappon, presented the theory and practical issues related to equity derivatives in a seminar organised by the union of institutional investors.</p>
<p>The seminar on equity derivatives in emerging markets was attended by the capital market commission president Stavros Thomadakis, Athens bourse president Manolis Xanthakis, SMEHA representative Spyros Kotzambasis and all member firms, it said.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
